   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +2 / -0",
   "html": "<p>A 2 kHz single tone signal is used to generate both AM and an FM signal. The modulation index β of FM signal is 8. If the frequency component at (<em>f<sub>c</sub></em> ± 2000) Hz have the same magnitude in AM as well as in FM signal, then the efficiency of the AM modulated signal is ________%. (upto two decimal places)<br />\n(Assume <em>J</em><sub>1</sub>(8) = 0.24)</p>",
